WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:03.997
Meet BOH-AI. This is where BOH ERP is going.

00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:08.244
Tell it about your company, and it trims the system to fit.

00:00:13.258 --> 00:00:17.048
Your team speaks German? One sentence, and the whole menu changes.

00:00:20.700 --> 00:00:22.990
New fields, exactly where you need them.

00:00:31.658 --> 00:00:34.807
Even your workflow rules, written the way you would say them.

00:00:43.533 --> 00:00:45.301
Your brand, in one line.

00:00:50.883 --> 00:00:53.440
And a whole new business, set up in seconds.

00:00:59.767 --> 00:01:04.381
BOH-AI is our goal, not a feature yet. Today, we set it up with you, by hand.
